window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>According to the ultrasounds, everything is fine with Jacinda and Luke’s expected baby, but as Jacinda’s dreams turn increasingly bizarre, she fears something is very wrong with their growing child.</p> <p>When the big day finally arrives, Jacinda’s worst fears lie cradled in her arms. But there’s only one way to save this youngling, and the cost could not only be high, it could be everything....</p> <p>Don't miss out on book five in this captivating YA science fantasy series. Download now!</p>"; 
